			<tr><th id="1">ナミアゲハ</th></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/imokore1_001.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/imokore1_001_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/imokore1/img/imokore1_001.jpg" --></a><a href="img/imokore1_002.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/imokore1_002_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/imokore1/img/imokore1_002.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/imokore1_003.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/imokore1_003_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/imokore1/img/imokore1_003.jpg" --></a><a href="img/imokore1_004.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/imokore1_004_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/imokore1/img/imokore1_004.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment">原型制作：松本栄一郎<br />
				<br />
				おなじみのアゲハチョウの幼虫。目玉模様が目立ちます。<br />
				柔らか素材のため、顔や脚の細かな部分の破損の心配はありません。</td></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/imokore1_005.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/imokore1_005_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/imokore1/img/imokore1_005.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment">2017年には<a href="../../../kaiyodo_Kit_Prepaint/SofubiToyBox/007imomushi">ソフビ版</a>が発売されました。<br />
				そちらも松本さん原型なので、カプセルQの拡大版だと思われます。</td></tr>
			<!--
			-->			
			<tr><th id="2">アオバセセリ</th></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/imokore1_010.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/imokore1_010_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/imokore1/img/imokore1_010.jpg" --></a><a href="img/imokore1_011.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/imokore1_011_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/imokore1/img/imokore1_011.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/imokore1_012.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/imokore1_012_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/imokore1/img/imokore1_012.jpg" --></a><a href="img/imokore1_013.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/imokore1_013_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/imokore1/img/imokore1_013.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment">原型制作：寺岡邦明<br />
				<br />
				頭にテントウムシが乗っているかのようなドハデなカラー。<br />
				白い帯にはさらに細い溝が刻まれています。</td></tr>
			<!--
			-->
			<tr><th id="3">アサギマダラ</th></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/imokore1_006.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/imokore1_006_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/imokore1/img/imokore1_006.jpg" --></a><a href="img/imokore1_007.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/imokore1_007_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/imokore1/img/imokore1_007.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/imokore1_008.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/imokore1_008_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/imokore1/img/imokore1_008.jpg" --></a><a href="img/imokore1_009.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/imokore1_009_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/imokore1/img/imokore1_009.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment">原型制作：田熊勝夫<br />
				<br />
				浅葱（あさぎ）色のチョウになるアサギマダラの幼虫。<br />
				特徴的な触角（？）が目立ちます。<br />
				白い斑点は個体によってもっと大きかったり小さかったりするようです。<br />
				<br />
				アサギマダラは2020年に社会現象にもなったアニメ「鬼滅の刃」にも登場する（もちろん成虫）ため、一部界隈ではひそかなブームになっているそうな。</td></tr>
			<!--
			-->			
			<tr><th id="4">シンジュサン</th></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/imokore1_014.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/imokore1_014_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/imokore1/img/imokore1_014.jpg" --></a><a href="img/imokore1_015.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/imokore1_015_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/imokore1/img/imokore1_015.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/imokore1_016.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/imokore1_016_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/imokore1/img/imokore1_016.jpg" --></a><a href="img/imokore1_017.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/imokore1_017_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/imokore1/img/imokore1_017.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment">原型制作：寺岡邦明<br />
				<br />
				ここからは蛾の幼虫。<br />
				シンジュサンは<a href="../../../anima/anima_japVII/index.html">ヨナグニサン</a>に似たヤママユガの仲間。<br />
				「神樹（しんじゅ）」はニワウルシの別名だそうです。<br />
				地味なカラーの成虫に対して、幼虫はゴツいトゲトゲの先端がブルーになっていて美しい。</td></tr>
			<!--
			-->
			<tr><th id="5">クロメンガタスズメ</th></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/imokore1_020.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/imokore1_020_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/imokore1/img/imokore1_020.jpg" --></a><a href="img/imokore1_021.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/imokore1_021_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/imokore1/img/imokore1_021.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/imokore1_022.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/imokore1_022_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/imokore1/img/imokore1_022.jpg" --></a><a href="img/imokore1_023.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/imokore1_023_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/imokore1/img/imokore1_023.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment">原型制作：田熊勝夫<br />
				<br />
				髑髏のような模様を持つ成虫はホラー映画「羊たちの沈黙」のポスターに使用されて有名となりました。<br />
				スズメガの特徴である湾曲した尻のトゲに注目。</td></tr>
			<!--
			-->			
			<tr><th id="6">アケビコノハ</th></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/imokore1_024.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/imokore1_024_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/imokore1/img/imokore1_024.jpg" --></a><a href="img/imokore1_025.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/imokore1_025_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/imokore1/img/imokore1_025.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/imokore1_027.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/imokore1_027_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/imokore1/img/imokore1_027.jpg" --></a><a href="img/imokore1_026.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/imokore1_026_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/imokore1/img/imokore1_026.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment">原型制作：松本栄一郎<br />
				<br />
				成虫は木の葉に擬態して危険を避けます。<br />
				（解説書に掲載の写真は誤りであることが<a href="http://www.capsuleq.in/m/catalog/13-9-20imocore/index.htm" target="_blank">公式サイト</a>に記載あります。）<br />
				幼虫は目玉模様を持ち、頭を隠し、目玉を持ち上げることで敵を威嚇するようです。<br />
				ベンダブル仕様ですが、こいつのみ最初から身体を曲げた状態で造形されています。</td></tr>
